
---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<section
    id="equipo"
    class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-50 via-[#fbf9ff] to-pink-50 px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20"
>

    <!-- =========================================
         DECORACIÓN DE FONDO
    ========================================== -->

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-32 top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-purple-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-32 top-40 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-pink-200/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-1/3 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-yellow-100/40 blur-3xl"
    ></div>

    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-10 top-10 text-4xl text-purple-200/70">
        ✦
    </div>

    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute right-16 top-24 text-5xl text-pink-200/70">
        ✦
    </div>

    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-16 right-10 text-4xl text-purple-200/60">
        ♥
    </div>


    <!-- =========================================
         CONTENIDO
    ========================================== -->

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl">

        <!-- =========================================
             VOLVER AL HOME
        ========================================== -->

        <div class="mb-10">
            <a
                href="/"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-purple-700 shadow-md ring-1 ring-purple-100 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-x-1 hover:bg-purple-50 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-purple-200"
            >
                <span class="text-lg">←</span>
                Volver al inicio
            </a>
        </div>


        <!-- =========================================
             LOGOS
        ========================================== -->

        <div class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6">

            <!-- SENA -->

            <div
                class="group flex h-28 w-40 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-purple-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"
            >
                <img
                    src="/sena.png"
                    class="max-h-20 w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
                    alt="Logo del SENA"
                />
            </div>


            <!-- COLEGIO -->

            <div
                class="group flex h-28 w-40 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-pink-100 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg"
            >
                <img
                    src="/colegio.png"
                    class="max-h-20 w-auto object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
                    alt="Logo del colegio"
                />
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- =========================================
             ENCABEZADO
        ========================================== -->

        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

            <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-pink-200 bg-pink-100 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-600 shadow-sm"
            >
                👥 Nuestro equipo
            </span>

            <h2
                class="mt-5 text-3xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight text-slate-800 md:text-5xl"
            >
                Integrantes del
                <span
                    class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-pink-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
                >
                    proyecto
                </span>
            </h2>

            <p
                class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base font-medium leading-7 text-slate-600 md:text-lg"
            >
                Conoce a las personas que aportaron sus conocimientos,
                creatividad y trabajo para construir este espacio de
                aprendizaje y apoyo.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- =========================================
             TARJETAS DEL EQUIPO
        ========================================== -->

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">


            <!-- =====================================
                 NICOL
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border border-purple-100 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    👑
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Líder del proyecto
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    Nicol Tatiana Suárez Alarcón
                </h3>

                <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-purple-500">✓</span>
                        Coordina al equipo.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-purple-500">✓</span>
                        Organiza tareas, reuniones y cronograma.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-purple-500">✓</span>
                        Hace seguimiento al avance del proyecto.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div
                    class="mt-6 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-purple-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>

            </article>


            <!-- =====================================
                 EVELYN
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border border-pink-100 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-pink-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    🎨
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Diseñadora web
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    Evelyn Geraldine Rodríguez López
                </h3>

                <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-pink-500">✓</span>
                        Diseña la apariencia de la página.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-pink-500">✓</span>
                        Define colores, tipografías, imágenes y distribución.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-pink-500">✓</span>
                        Busca que la web sea fácil de usar.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div
                    class="mt-6 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-pink-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>

            </article>


            <!-- =====================================
                 LARIETH
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border border-yellow-100 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-yellow-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    📝
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Administradora de contenido
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    Larieth Zaray Neira Ruiz
                </h3>

                <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-yellow-600">✓</span>
                        Redacta y organiza la información.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-yellow-600">✓</span>
                        Revisa ortografía y calidad del contenido.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-yellow-600">✓</span>
                        Mantiene el contenido claro y organizado.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div
                    class="mt-6 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-yellow-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>

            </article>


            <!-- =====================================
                 MARÍA JOSÉ
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border border-blue-100 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    🔍
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Tester / pruebas
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    María José Alarcón Preciado
                </h3>

                <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-blue-500">✓</span>
                        Prueba la página en diferentes dispositivos.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-blue-500">✓</span>
                        Detecta errores.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-blue-500">✓</span>
                        Propone mejoras para el funcionamiento.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div
                    class="mt-6 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-blue-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>

            </article>


            <!-- =====================================
                 SAMUEL
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border border-green-100 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-green-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    💻
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Desarrollador web
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    Samuel Esteban Rivera Hernández
                </h3>

                <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-green-600">✓</span>
                        Programa la página web.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-green-600">✓</span>
                        Implementa funciones, formularios y menús.
                    </li>

                    <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                        <span class="font-black text-green-600">✓</span>
                        Trabaja en las funcionalidades del proyecto.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div
                    class="mt-6 h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-green-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-20"
                ></div>

            </article>


            <!-- =====================================
                 PROYECTO
            ====================================== -->

            <article
                class="group rounded-[1.7rem] border-2 border-dashed border-purple-200 bg-white/80 p-7 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-purple-300 hover:shadow-xl"
            >

                <div
                    class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-2xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"
                >
                    🎓
                </div>

                <span
                    class="mt-5 block text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-pink-500"
                >
                    Nuestro propósito
                </span>

                <h3
                    class="mt-2 text-xl font-black leading-tight text-purple-700"
                >
                    Un proyecto hecho en equipo
                </h3>

                <p
                    class="mt-5 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600"
                >
                    Cada integrante aportó diferentes habilidades para
                    crear una experiencia educativa, clara, segura e
                    interactiva.
                </p>

                <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-purple-600">
                    <span>💜</span>
                    <span>Aprender juntos hace la diferencia.</span>
                </div>

            </article>

        </div>


        <!-- =========================================
             CIERRE
        ========================================== -->

        <div class="mt-14 text-center">

            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">
                Gracias a todos los integrantes que hicieron posible este proyecto.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-3 flex justify-center gap-2 text-xl">
                💜 ✨ 👥 ✨ 💜
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

